<section class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-12 mb-24 lg:mb-48">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-32">
    <h2 class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-3 font-heading font-medium text-lg uppercase tracking-widest text-swiss-white mt-1">About</h2>
    <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-9">
      
      <div class="mb-16">
        <p class="font-sans text-xl lg:text-3xl leading-relaxed text-swiss-white mb-6 max-w-4xl">Active in the electronic music scene since 1998, Jan Zelinger (Ian Kita) is a veteran of the European underground.</p>
        <p class="font-sans text-xl lg:text-3xl leading-relaxed text-swiss-white max-w-4xl">Evolving from vinyl roots into a staple of modern Techno and Tech House, his sound is defined by relentless energy, industrial textures, and deep, hypnotic rhythms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16 pt-12 border-t-[1px] border-white/10">
        
        <div>
