          <ul class="font-sans text-swiss-white text-base space-y-3 p-0 m-0 list-none">
            <li><span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-12">2023</span> 3rd Place, Bass Awards (DJ & Producer)</li>
            <li><span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-12">2011</span> Debuted as Ian Kita / First Solo EP</li>
            <li><span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-12">2003</span> First Vinyl Release (Samopal Records)</li>
            <li><span class="text-swiss-red font-medium inline-block w-12">1999</span> Began performing as DJ Kita</li>
